            "review_text": "drj1mmy\n4 contributions\n0\nNever had great curry abroad except in India.\nNov 2025 • Solo\nAs a regular curry eater from England this wasn’t the best. Bajis dry/ onions cut micro thin. Medium curry was medium but all spice, no taste, and 4-5 small bones. No breast meat whatsoever. Garlic naan was so powerfully garlic I even left some of that. The Huda beer was excellent tho 😂\nMaybe this is Indian curry for Vietnamese but wouldn’t last long in England.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 8, 2025",
