            "review_title": "Review at Ish - The Indian Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Min\nUnited Kingdom3 contributions\n0\nAuthentic Punjabi Flavours in the Heart of Da Nang\nAug 2025 • Family\nWe were visiting Da Nang and, being Punjabi, really missed home food. Trying an Indian restaurant here felt like a risk – but it was absolutely amazing! The dal makhani, pani poori, roti, and biryani were all delicious. The boys were amazed and so thankful for such authentic flavours so far from home. Highly recommend!\nWritten August 11, 2025",
