            "review_text": "MViale\nWest Palm Beach, Florida21 contributions\n0\nYou need something more than ISH\nApr 2025 • Couples\nBeware, I was craving spices and ate here with my husband,it looks well put and varied Indian food,we were just us in this place , they gave us the menu, and service took like 10 minutes to come to the table, I had to call them, they reacted as they had forgotten we were there. They brought veg spring rolls and I was hsppy , they brought the lentils Tarka Dahl, spicy yes but salty too, so it was difficult to eat, the curried fish and chicken tika masala were salty as well, but my husband had asked for a mild approach to his and they did not listen. Yes, you go to an Indian restaurant you know what to expect in flavors but they asked level of spice. So beware. Since we couldn’t eat the whole thing they gave us the left overs to take home. The best thing we ate was the jeera rice. Now comes the part that you need to hear, at home, I tool the Tarka Dahl the next day, and within the quietness in my home noticed tiny brown bugs in it, 😑 lentils had bugs!!!\nRead more\nWritten April 28, 2025",
