            "review_text": "Hemster7\nTampa, Florida262 contributions\n0\nDelectable Indian food in Da Nang!\nMar 2025 • Family\nRight across the river, this place has great views from the second floor. The food is amazing as is the courteous service. \n\nWe dined at this restaurant twice during our time in Da Nang. The dishes during our first visit were all wonderful, however the bhindi (okra) curry during our second visit were too oily. Overall very decent.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nIf you don't like your curry oily, ask for it to be made with less oil.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 20, 2025",
